  BUG: `presolve` option in `milp` causing feasible problem to be reported as infeasible. 
### Describe your issue.

When setting `presolve=True` via `options` dictionary in `scipy.optimize.milp` a feasible problem is being reported as infeasible. The exact same problem is "made" feasible by simply swapping to `presolve=False`. 

Alternatively changing `c` also seems to make the problem feasible. Changing `c` should not change whether a problem is feasible or not. 

